# What outdoor activities do people like?
I think it mainly depends on people’s age and personal preferences. Older people usually enjoy relaxing outdoor activities such as walking in parks, doing light exercise, or simply sitting and chatting with friends while enjoying the fresh air and green surroundings.

Younger people, on the other hand, often prefer more active and energetic activities like playing football, cycling, hiking, or camping. These activities are not only enjoyable but also help people stay healthy both physically and mentally. In addition, outdoor activities can be a great way to reduce stress and spend quality time with friends or family.

# What are the differences between the outdoor activities children did in the past and now?
I think there are quite a few differences between the outdoor activities children did in the past and those they do nowadays.

In the past, children often played traditional outdoor games such as hide-and-seek, skipping rope, or tag. They usually spent a lot of time outside with large groups of friends, climbing trees, running around, or playing sports in their neighborhoods. I think these activities were very beneficial because they encouraged physical exercise as well as social and cognitive development.

Nowadays, children are growing up in a world heavily influenced by technology, so they are constantly exposed to devices like smartphones, tablets, and televisions from a very young age. As a result, many of them prefer activities involving modern gadgets, such as flying drones, riding electric scooters, or even staying indoors to play video games and watch short videos on platforms like TikTok.

Personally, I think this shift has both positive and negative effects. Technology can be entertaining and educational, but spending too much time indoors may reduce children’s physical activity and social interaction skills.

# Is leisure time important to everyone? Why?
Yes, definitely. I think leisure time is extremely important for everyone because it helps people maintain both their physical and mental well-being. Nowadays, many people are under constant pressure from work, financial responsibilities, and social expectations, so having time to relax is essential.

Leisure activities allow people to recharge, clear their minds, and temporarily escape from daily stress. For example, some people enjoy taking a walk in the park, going swimming, watching movies, or simply spending time chatting with friends and family.

Without enough leisure time, people can easily become stressed, exhausted, or even burned out, which may negatively affect their productivity, health, and overall quality of life. That’s why I believe maintaining a good work-life balance is becoming more important than ever.

# Do women have more leisure time than men?
I think it really depends on the culture and lifestyle of each family. In some traditional societies, women may have less leisure time because they are often expected to handle childcare, cooking, and housework in addition to their jobs. As a result, they may have fewer opportunities to relax or enjoy personal hobbies.

However, in many modern families nowadays, household responsibilities are shared more equally between men and women, so the difference in leisure time is becoming smaller. I also think it depends more on a person’s career, lifestyle, and priorities rather than gender alone. Some people choose to spend more time working, while others prefer to maintain a better work-life balance..

# What are the benefits of outdoor activities for children?
Outdoor activities are extremely beneficial for children in many ways. First of all, they help improve physical health because children can run around, play sports, and stay active, which reduces the risk of obesity and other health problems.

In addition, outdoor activities help children develop important social skills. When kids play games or participate in group activities, they learn how to communicate, cooperate, and work as a team. I also think spending time outdoors can improve their mental well-being because being close to nature often helps children feel happier and less stressed.

Moreover, outdoor activities encourage curiosity and creativity since children have more opportunities to explore the world around them and try new experiences. Overall, I believe outdoor play is an important part of a child’s development.

# Do you think that walking is not as helpful as playing other sports for our health?
I wouldn’t agree with that. Although high-intensity sports like running, swimming, or football may provide faster fitness results and burn more calories, walking is still a very effective form of exercise.

One major advantage of walking is that it’s low-impact, so it’s suitable for people of all ages, including elderly people or those with health problems. Regular walking can improve cardiovascular health, strengthen muscles, and even reduce stress and anxiety.

Another reason why walking is beneficial is that it’s easy to include in daily routines. For example, people can walk to work, take the stairs, or go for a walk after dinner without needing special equipment or much preparation. So overall, I think walking may be less intense than some sports, but it is still extremely valuable for maintaining a healthy lifestyle.
